Samples from the Dubtrain Angband Sound Pack by Dubtrain <angband@dubtrain.com>,
licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0), as shipped with
upstream Angband (github.com/angband/angband, lib/sounds). Only the samples
NLarn's sound events use are copied here by web/sounds.py; sounds.json maps
each event to its samples.
